<title>SRI LANKA: James Finlay 3-month net up 94 pct.</title>
<headline>James Finlay 3-month net up 94 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of James Finlay &amp; Co Ltd for three months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			  1997	     1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	 276.36   vs    252.74</p>
<p>    Net profit	14.89   vs	7.67</p>
<p>    Tax		  3.67   vs	1.61</p>
<p>NOTE - James Finlay &amp; Co exports tea, manages plantations, and is involved in travel and tourism and selling industrial and agro chemicals.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
